tin for this table. The output is a page number (integer).", "question_kind": "page_number", "vintage": "latest", "period": null}, "error": null, "elapsed_s": 29.89}
{"uid": "UID0012", "question": "What was the amount spent in millions of nominal dollars by the highest spending U.S Federal Department in the fiscal year of 1955?", "gold_answer": "36080 million", "gold_files": ["treasury_bulletin_1958_10.txt"], "spec": {"computation": "max", "data_requests": [{"id": "v1", "label": "Spending by each U.S. Federal Department in FY 1955", "source": "corpus", "row_hint": "Department", "row_hint_alternatives": ["Agriculture Department", "Defense Department", "Treasury Department", "Interior Department", "State Department", "Justice Department", "Commerce Department", "Labor Department", "Health, Education, and Welfare", "Post Office Department", "Executive Office of the President", "The Judiciary", "Legislative Branch", "Veterans Administration", "Atomic Energy Commission", "General Services Administration", "Small Business Administration", "National Aeronautics and Space Administration", "Federal Deposit Insurance Corp.", "Commodity Credit Corporation", "Tennessee Valley Authority", "Export-Import Bank of Washington", "Federal Home Loan Banks", "Reconstruction Finance Corp.", "Other independent agencies"], "column_hint": "1955", "section_hint": "Budget", "years": [1955], "granularity": "annual", "start_year": null, "start_month": null, "end_year": null, "end_month": null, "expected_count": null, "cohort": true, "retrieval_hint": {"channel_preference": "metric_exact", "must_match_phrases": ["Department"], "avoid_phrases": ["Total", "All other", "Other:"]}}], "computation_spec": {"python_template": "result = max(values['v1'])"}, "output_format": {"type": "number", "unit": "millions", "rounding": null, "as_percent": false}, "resolution_notes": "The question asks for the highest spending U.S. Federal Department in FY 1955. I interpret 'Department' broadly to include major executive departments and independent agencies (like Veterans Administration, Atomic Energy Commission) that are listed as separate rows in budget tables. The cohort should include all rows that represent a federal department/agency, excluding 'Total' and 'All other' rows. The exact row labels may vary; I've provided a list of plausible alternatives based on the corpus labels. The column should be FY 1955. The output is the maximum spending amount among those departments, in millions of nominal dollars.", "question_kind": "value", "vintage": "latest", "period": "FY"}, "error": null, "elapsed_s": 31.47}
