ing for trust fund receipts. The column should be the fiscal year 2004. The unit is nominal dollars; rounding to nearest whole number is specified in output_format.", "question_kind": "value", "vintage": "latest", "period": "FY"}, "error": null, "elapsed_s": 17.69}
